# Check out every text file with LF line endings, on every system. The checks compare whole
# lines. A checkout with CRLF line endings (core.autocrlf=true) makes the checks fail.
* text=auto eol=lf
# A pinned copy of a source file keeps its bytes: --evidence of build-roadmap.mjs compares it with
# the file of the source repo at the snapshot, CRLF and all.
sources/** -text
